# DS Remote public HTTPS gateway.
# {{HOSTNAME}} is replaced at install time, e.g. 129-146-10-25.sslip.io.
# Caddy terminates TLS (Let's Encrypt) and reverse-proxies to the
# loopback-only gateway. Streaming (SSE) is preserved by Caddy's default
# reverse_proxy behavior; no buffering middleware is added.
{{HOSTNAME}} {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
}
